# M7. Stale feedback mid-move: the arm's servo 3 stops answering, so the arm has no fresh reading. The Pi
# latches feedback_stale and stops writing goals to that arm (it never writes a goal from a stale reading).
expect motion mode ready
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key pose-ready-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose started operator_cli
wait 200
key stale-left
expect motion fault feedback_stale arm_left
expect motion goals-stopped arm_left
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose faulted operator_cli
key motion-status
absent 1500 sim goal-write left follower
key inspect-hold-left
expect sim left follower hold ok
# Answering again: the fault can be cleared.
key stale-left
wait 300
key operator-clear
wait 2100
key c
expect motion cleared all faults
key q
